        "original_id": "cfa87755-c3be-5e02-a0a3-4921adaa9fc0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nancy Sullivan\n- Roles: Maine State Senator\n- Places: Maine's 4th District, York County, Biddeford, Kennebunkport, Arundel, Kennebunk, Maine\n- Topics: 2010 census population\n\nFacts:\n- From 2004 to 2012, Nancy Sullivan served as a Democrat Maine State Senator for Maine's 4th District.\n- Maine's 4th District represented part of York County, including Biddeford, Kennebunkport, Arundel, and Kennebunk.\n- At the 2010 census, Kennebunk, Maine, had a population of 10,798.\n- The 2010 census population for Kennebunk did not include Kennebunkport, which is a separate town.",
